---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import { SITE } from "../data/site";
---
<Layout title="Contact" description="How to connect with Alok Thakur and the Engineering Lab.">
<main class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 py-12 sm:px-6 sm:py-16 lg:py-20">
  <header class="max-w-3xl border-b border-neutral-900 pb-10">
    <p class="lab-label mb-4">Connect / Engineering Lab</p>
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl">Let's build something worth documenting.</h1>
    <p class="mt-5 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-8 text-neutral-400">The Lab is public by design. For collaboration, technical discussion, project feedback or open-source work, GitHub is the current public contact point.</p>
  </header>

  <section class="mt-10 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-3" aria-labelledby="contact-options-heading">
    <h2 id="contact-options-heading" class="sr-only">Contact options</h2>
    <a href={SITE.links.github} target="_blank" rel="me external" class="group min-h-32 border border-neutral-900 p-6 transition hover:border-neutral-700 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4 focus-visible:outline-white">
      <p class="lab-label">Open source / collaboration</p>
      <div class="mt-4 flex items-center justify-between gap-4"><span class="text-xl font-bold">GitHub</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1">↗</span></div>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-neutral-500">@Exploiter69</p>
    </a>
    <a href="/resume.pdf" target="_blank" class="group min-h-32 border border-neutral-900 p-6 transition hover:border-neutral-700 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4 focus-visible:outline-white">
      <p class="lab-label">Profile / PDF</p>
      <div class="mt-4 flex items-center justify-between gap-4"><span class="text-xl font-bold">Resume</span><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></div>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-neutral-500">A concise engineering profile generated from the public Lab record.</p>
    </a>
    <a href="/projects" class="group min-h-32 border border-neutral-900 p-6 transition hover:border-neutral-700 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4 focus-visible:outline-white">
      <p class="lab-label">See the work first</p>
      <div class="mt-4 flex items-center justify-between gap-4"><span class="text-xl font-bold">Projects</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1">→</span></div>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-neutral-500">Read the engineering records, constraints and evidence.</p>
    </a>
  </section>

  <section class="mt-12 border-t border-neutral-900 pt-8">
    <p class="lab-label">A note on contact details</p>
    <p class="mt-3 max-w-2xl text-sm leading-7 text-neutral-500">Email and LinkedIn are not invented here because no verified public destinations are stored in the repository. The downloadable resume is generated from the verified public engineering record.</p>
  </section>
</main>
</Layout>
